      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pain is a complex phenomena that is at best illusive in the neonate. Pain management has become a hot topic in the neonatal field due to recent research on neonatal pain response that is changing the way we view pain perception and management. Specific information on the assessment and treatment of pain in neonates is offered along with methods of strategic planning to assist nurses to advocate for improved neonatal pain management."},
